  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 8e70547d8134d5943ac3fafcae79c9dc, type: 3}
  m_Name: GeraldandGoats
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::EventData
  title: Gerald's Goats
  description: On your way to the grassland, the goats started acting funny... All
    of them broke off their leashes and started scattering in all directions. Getting
    them back is now your first priority.
  image: {fileID: 0}
  backgroundImage: {fileID: 0}
  choices:
  - choiceText: Ignore the goats and leave the village
    outcomeText: You missed the part where that's your problem. Leaving the village
      seems to be the best thing to do now. These goats are probably just happy to
      stretch their legs for a while. They will come back on their own... surely.
      Right?
    goldChange: 0
    hpChangePercent: 0
    recruitCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    grantItems: []
    costItems: []
  - choiceText: (Zavren) Use elemental magic
    outcomeText: Zavren used his elemental magic to accelerate food growth for the
      goats, after about 15 minutes they all returned to Gerald with their stomach's
      full and Gerald happy. (+5 gold, + item)
    goldChange: 5
    hpChangePercent: 0
    recruitCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    grantItems:
    - {fileID: 11400000, guid: b5978f5efd036c343b81cf7a09074f58, type: 2}
    costItems: []
  - choiceText: Chase after them
    outcomeText: 'Each one of you took note of one goat and started chasing after
      it. After about one hour of running around the village, you managed to catch
      them all. This didn''t come without some acidents though... (+5 gold, -5% HP) '
    goldChange: 5
    hpChangePercent: 5
    recruitCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    grantItems: []
    costItems: []
